{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41622","headline":"游子吟 · 陈陶","name":"游子吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖乌喜林曙，惊蓬伤岁阑。\n关河三尺雪，何处是天山？\n朔风无重衣，仆马饥且寒。\n惨戚别妻子，迟回出门难。\n男儿值休明，岂是长泥蟠。\n何者爲木偶，何人侍金銮。\n郁郁守贫贱，悠悠亦无端。\n进不图功名，退不处岩峦。\n穷通在何日，光景如跳丸。\n富贵苦不早，令人摧心肝。\n誓期春之阳，一振摩霄翰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}